#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.played/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid ""
"The games you played last, with their covers: one click and you're back in"
msgstr ""
"Spelen du spelade senast, med sina omslag: ett klick så är du tillbaka i spelet"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.quick/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Quick Settings"
msgstr "Snabbinställningar"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.quick/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid "Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, sound, brightness and Monet's light in one place"
msgstr ""
"Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, ljud, ljusstyrka och Monets ljus, samlat på ett ställe"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.system/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "System"
msgstr "System"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.system/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid ""
"How hard your PC is working: the processor, the graphics and the memory, how warm they run, and what's downloading"
msgstr ""
"Hur hårt din dator arbetar: processorn, grafiken och minnet, hur varma de blir och vad som laddas ner"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.timer/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Timer"
msgstr "Timer"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.timer/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid ""
"A few minutes on the sun's path: for the tea, a break, or one more match"
msgstr "Några minuter längs solens bana: för teet, en paus eller en match till"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.weather/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Weather"
msgstr "Väder"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.weather/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid "The sky where you are, painted on Monet's glass"
msgstr "Himlen där du är, målad på Monets glas"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.worldclock/metadata.json
